Обязательные метрики (minimum set):

- HTTP: `http_requests_total`, `http_request_duration_seconds`, `http_5xx_total`;
- Kafka: `kafka_consumer_lag`, `kafka_messages_processed_total`, `kafka_dlq_total`;
- Бизнес: `registrations_created_total`, `payments_succeeded_total`, `payments_failed_total`, `checkin_total`;
- Инфраструктура: `db_pool_in_use`, `redis_connected_clients`, `container_cpu_usage_seconds_total`, `container_memory_usage_bytes`.

Обязательные алерты (minimum set):

- `HighErrorRate`;
- `HighLatencyP95`;
- `KafkaLagCritical`;
- `DLQGrowthDetected`;
- `PaymentWebhookFailureBurst`;
- `AuthServiceUnavailable`;
- `DatabasePoolExhaustion`;
- `Nginx5xxCritical`.